  "description": "At 28, Seo Yeon-Ho reunites with Ju Geon-U, his childhood first love, with only one thing on his mind: revenge. Determined to expose Geon-U's weaknesses, Yeon-Ho dives back into his life, only to find that his former crush has become a famous actor. But instead of gaining the upper hand, Yeon-Ho ends up being endlessly teased and outplayed by the very man he swore to take down…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
